  "worked_solution": "Since we need to multiply $\\frac{2}{5}$ by $2$, we repeat the fraction model $2$ times, as shown below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14129810/assets/edd22792b22b7a3c98b93b1a0baadbfcd79148e6b317ae5b789cb7599a8afb2e.png)\n\n \n\nThere are $2\\times 2=4$ shaded pieces in total. Therefore, \n\n$$\n2\\times \\frac{2}{5}=\\frac{4}{5}.\n$$",
